; Merge into game/echo_lattice/project.godot (Godot 4.3+).
; Steamworks readiness — offline stub by default; GodotSteam optional.
;
; Autoload order matters:
;   SaveManager → SteamService (optional cloud pull) → ChamberBook → GameState (load)
;
; Feature flags: res://config/steam_features.json
; Achievement catalog: res://config/achievements_steam.json
; Docs: docs/RELEASE/STEAMWORKS.md · docs/RELEASE/GODOTSTEAM.md
; Missing GodotSteam with steam_enabled → fail-closed (no fake Steam APIs).

[autoload]

SaveManager="*res://scripts/save_manager.gd"
SteamService="*res://scripts/steam/steam_service.gd"
ChamberBook="*res://scripts/chamber_book.gd"
GameState="*res://scripts/game_state.gd"
